 		<English>[H1]World Advisor Territory Legend[\H1][PARAGRAPH:2]The Territory tab counts plots and map assets owned by the selected player.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]BFC: owned plots inside at least one selected-player city BFC.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Sub: suburbs; owned plots outside all selected-player city BFCs.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Tot: BFC plus Sub.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]In Plots, Water, Peak, Hill and Flat partition all owned plots, so Total is their real plot count. River, Lake and Coastal overlap those rows; for example, a riverside Grassland Hill is both Hill and River. Terrain and Features are split because every plot has one terrain, while only some have a feature.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Hidden or unexplored plots and bonuses stay hidden unless debug mode is active. Hover row icons for tooltips, or click them to open Sevopedia entries when available.</English>
